{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "326674719d48a7273f487a9892327f1e41bb22e4d92123a6fe0a6accfa271705", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画で、雪歩が焼肉店のPR大使に\n挑戦。今日は雪歩が考案したメニューの最終確認だ）", "zh": "（在角色扮演写真企划中，雪步挑战担任烤肉店的宣传大使。今天要最终确认雪步构思的菜单。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "438a8935cd113eea107f1edf1c5f6984d143696bb4ed9907c80349c4ec8400e4", "ja": "えーっと……分量……バランス……。\n右回りで……リズム感……うーん……。", "zh": "那个……分量……平衡……。\n顺时针……节奏感……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1968c9592a29c895cc18edc7e9d79b3ea2b92a3b7fa5e0b730fe24097583f1bb", "ja": "どうだ、雪歩？", "zh": "雪步，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e6312a9b55ba3970e80af4173469de9ac46dc0c11b7ca03dabc2ca72e38bfad6", "ja": "はい、バッチリです。\n限定メニュー『満腹レオパード盛り』の完成ですぅ！", "zh": "是的，完美无缺。\n限定菜单“吃撑豹纹拼盘”完成啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d630de773772ba860316016356f219642ada69fc30dcaa03233917784b110b17", "ja": "おお～。名前まで考えていたとは。\n雪歩の気合いが伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "哦～，连名字都想好了啊。能感受到雪步的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3a057c4794d83220eae9ecbf2d34e287ced5b66fd7def9f13b4d884a10ceea65", "ja": "えへへ♪　私みたいによわよわな人間が、メニューを\n考えるなんて厚かましいかもって思いましたけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我觉得，像我这样弱弱的人，居然要来设计菜单，可能有点不自量力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d4fac513937f3e308dff45253ad4a860286719eec0422e6e8385b9806a5a0977", "ja": "こんな機会、もう二度とないかもしれないので、\n全力でやろうって決めてたんです！", "zh": "这种机会，说不定以后再也不会有了，所以我决定要全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0a3b207b2cd1ce5f8aac3e0f273dcfe0d0e0314903bec8df817850fa22323642", "ja": "そうだったのか。みたところ、それぞれ少量だけど、\nたくさんの種類のお肉が盛り付けられてるんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。看起来每种肉虽然只有一点，但种类还真不少，都摆在一起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "210ecefd230641c3826681c8bb71c54c063f1133f99f749c131fc07b0d3135e4", "ja": "はい。どんなメニューにしようか考えた時に、\n思いついたんです。ヒョウみたいにしようって！", "zh": "是的。我在考虑要做什么菜单时，突然想到了——做成豹子一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d02dfc009e272549c585fc56bcf14d345272d4cf58a7a7dc97ac18a1f38f4b18", "ja": "ヒョウみたいに？", "zh": "像豹子一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0c53c631af2ff6c509cab73c5a0c4e33d729ebcbc14927f765f29d715cac107f", "ja": "そうです。えっと、ヒョウはいろんな動物を食べるん\nです。それで、たくさん種類があるといいな、って。", "zh": "对。那个，豹子会吃各种各样的动物。所以，我想要是种类多一点就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9c9de05d2faecc3413f327479c9e4496f80b9e1722d190fc9e611b5afd803256", "ja": "一人で食べれば贅沢な気持ちになりますし、\nみんなでシェアするのも、楽しいと思うんです。", "zh": "一个人吃的话会有种奢侈的感觉，大家一起分享的话，我觉得也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bf3b5cb82fa1f15370b0f6bd1f182058c1d5825e3596a1cccd5b58926d443efa", "ja": "食べた人のお腹はもちろん、心もいっぱいに……\nそうなってくれたら嬉しいです！", "zh": "吃到的人，不仅肚子，连心里也都能被填得满满的……要是能这样，我会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fa651f08f2ac86bb9a64e64e9428457aed135f84ce3266a0ce6749072ee28852", "ja": "なるほど。雪歩の思いやりが詰まってるってわけか。\nきっと、ファンの人達も喜んでくれると思う。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，里面满载着雪步的体贴之心啊。\n我想，粉丝们肯定也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b7a0843b3b8b6f945e9244b978cc6d4e75d32a241f93203acf4073c5fa4ac2da", "ja": "メニューは決まったし、早速、試食してみよう。\nまずは、どのお肉から……。うん、これに決め……", "zh": "菜单已经定好了，那就马上试吃吧。先从哪块肉开始……嗯，就决定是这块……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a7764397eb35dcf1bb0b89aa9018e04c7a3603a50eeca17fbe752d32d821a277", "ja": "ちょっと待ったぁ～！　ちゃんと順番が決まってるん\nです。その通りに焼かないとダメなんですぅ！", "zh": "等等——！顺序已经规定好了。必须按照那个顺序来烤才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b871c8ad27405603c94c0a480611aebb3ccbd0427a976be7bc4e60ba317723d3", "ja": "えっ、順番？", "zh": "诶，顺序？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "088d5c8518486aed04116086207a06981def4e764c92eac590d25e2c9af00f76", "ja": "はい！　一番上から右回りで焼いていくと、バランスが\nいいんです。私が焼きますから、見ててください！", "zh": "好的！从最上面的开始顺时针烤，火候会比较均匀。我来烤，请看着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1018_p", "source_sha256": "01aee632819156ec4a21691a86d716a3c519d6b56e0f1b564a4dd6ea0c743661", "ja": "あ、はい……わかりました。\nお願いします……！", "zh": "啊，好的……我明白了。\n拜托您了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a1785e4c3f2e347e7fb745054906c841103e67d7098da3f59a0a6dae2b435d58", "ja": "網のどこに置くか……お肉の厚みや火力も考慮すると、\n今回は13時の位置が最適。次いで、15時方向……。", "zh": "放在烤网上的什么位置……还要考虑肉的厚度和火力，这次以13点钟方向的位置最合适。其次是15点钟方向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0533_1020_p", "source_sha256": "482c92092633a67d149a3e161394bc35a939ba00801a98dadb2707d10d71aa54", "ja": "（焼肉と真剣に向き合う雪歩の姿が広報写真として\n大抜擢。限定メニューも飛ぶように売れたらしい……）", "zh": "（雪步认真对待烤肉的身影被破格选作宣传照片。听说限定菜单也卖得飞快……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
